# Lunduke Terminal is the default terminal (hook 5020 pins
# x-terminal-emulator). Command Center is the settings front end.
# Recommends are off, so list the retro fonts here. These are every
# font package in cool-retro-term's Depends (checked against the
# trixie binary: fonts-pc, fonts-pc-extra, fonts-3270, fonts-agave,
# fonts-inconsolata, fonts-sixtyfour, fonts-amiga, fonts-atarismall),
# plus fonts-terminus for Lunduke Terminal's CRT profiles. The Qt
# Quick modules that cool-retro-term also Depends on are not listed.
lunduke-terminal
fonts-pc
fonts-pc-extra
fonts-3270
fonts-agave
fonts-inconsolata
fonts-sixtyfour
fonts-amiga
fonts-atarismall
fonts-terminus
